# The citation of the pipeline, with the paper that describes the dataset and the pipeline as the
# preferred citation. Each release of the dataset contains a CITATION.cff of its own, which
# agentcontext/steps/release.py writes with the same authors and the same preferred citation. The
# DOI of the pipeline is the concept DOI of its Zenodo record, and the DOI of the paper is the DOI
# that arXiv registered for its preprint.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this pipeline, please cite the paper that describes it.
